        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Gestures16** brings the full native iOS gesture navigation to Home button iPhones.\n\nIt enables gesture mode on iPhone 8, iPhone SE (2020) and iPhone SE (2022) running iOS 16.0 – 16.7.16, so your device works just like a Face ID iPhone.\n\n**Features:**\n- Full native iOS gesture system: swipe up to go Home, open the App Switcher and swipe between apps\n- iPhone X-style status bar\n- Quick Actions (Flashlight and Camera) on the Lock Screen\n\n**Note:** so far the tweak has only been tested on iPhone 8. iPhone 8 Plus is expected to work, but haven't been tested yet.\n\nThere are no settings yet — just install and respring."
